있어요!","source_cn":"果然有修士在这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C08B986AD9F05AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1322208002:0":{"text":"드워프도 있네요? 어서 무슨 일이 있었는지 물어봐요!","source_cn":"矮人也在？快去问问他们发生了什么事吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2642787F0789B090","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222090.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222090","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322209001:1":{"text":"세인트 킨가 성당은 보수를 하지 않은 지 오래 되었는데, 며칠 전에 눈이 내리면서 기둥이 위험해졌습니다. 어서 장인을 불러 수리해야 해요.","source_cn":"圣金嘉教堂年久失修，前些日子下了场大雪，现在房梁岌岌可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB24AF5EA601DFE79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322209002:1":{"text":"하지만 성당에는 일손이 부족해서, 그렇게 많은 건축 자재를 옮겨올 수 없어요.","source_cn":"可是教堂的人手太少了，根本搬运不来那么多建材。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAF5BAF34EB8EA07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1322209002":{"text":"하지만 성당에는 일손이 부족해서, 그렇게 많은 건축 자재를 옮겨올 수 없어요.","source_cn":"可是教堂的人手太少了，根本搬运不来那么多建材。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAF5BAF34EB8EA07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322209003:1":{"text":"정말인가요? 감사합니다! 그럼 자재를 모아 와주세요.","source_cn":"真的吗？太好了！还请你们帮忙收集一些建材回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCCD71050E3CADED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"우리가 도와줄게","source_cn":"我们可以帮你","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8116235F40D84F11","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리가 도와줄게","female":"우리가 도와줄게","variant_male_record_index":"70006","variant_female_record_index":"70007","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修士达尼尔":{"text":"수도사 다니엘","source":"修士达尼尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222110.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222110","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322211001:0":{"text":"저쪽에 돌이 있어요. 야수를 돌에 부딪치게 해봐요!","source_cn":"那里有石头！快让它撞上石头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B29E148A69F9E79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222120.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222120","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322212001:0":{"text":"후, 드디어 빠져나왔네요...","source_cn":"呼，终于逃出来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BAE828F706FB975","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1322212002:0":{"text":"몬스터가 갑자기 나타나서 정말 무서웠어요...","source_cn":"怪物出现得好突然！太可怕了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19F33D2AB013B423","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222130.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222130","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322213001:1":{"text":"자재를 전부 모으셨나요? 정말 빠르시네요!","source_cn":"你们把建材都收集好了？这么快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF611B9A2025BC4CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322213002:1":{"text":"감사합니다. 자재가 전부 흐트러져 있는 걸 보니 오는 길이 많이 험하셨던 모양이군요.","source_cn":"谢谢你们，路上一定很不容易吧？瞧，建材都散乱了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4A25BB0FA3E96A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322213003:1":{"text":"야수를 피하려다가 자재가 흐트러진 모양이에요. 어서 정리해서 수도사에게 전해주도록 해요.","source_cn":"应该是在躲避野兽的时候弄乱的，我们把建材整理好再交给修士吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31405B3967BA7AF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322213004:1":{"text":"정리가 끝났으면 옆에 계신 장인에게 주시면 됩니다. 저는 수리를 할 줄 모르거든요.","source_cn":"诸位整理好交给旁边的工匠即可，毕竟我也不会修复呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51B446E61DB8FAAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修士达尼尔":{"text":"수도사 다니엘","source":"修士达尼尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222140.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222140","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322214001:0":{"text":"자재 정리가 끝났어요! 어서 드워프 장인에게 전달해요!","source_cn":"这下建材都整整齐齐的了！快去交给矮人工匠吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85F12A7D1ED3CCB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222150.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222150","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322215001:1":{"text":"오호, 자재를 가져왔군! 드디어 새로운 자재가 왔으니 작업을 시작할 수 있겠어!","source_cn":"哦嚯，你们把建材带来了呀！终于有新材料了，开工！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x927C584CDB5AF7F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322215002:1":{"text":"이러면 복구 작업도 순조로울 거야. 전부 너희들 덕분이지!","source_cn":"这样修复的工作就能顺利完成了，多亏了你们呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4066065201E95ADC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人格瑞":{"text":"드워프 그레이","source":"矮人格瑞","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/timeline/quest_story/13222100.json":{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13222100","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322210001:1":{"text":"자재를 전부 다 모았네요! 이제 돌아가도 되겠어요.","source_cn":"终于收集完啦，可以回去交差了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA4BE4C4B216B32A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322210002:1":{"text":"치피, 조심해! 야수가 있어!","source_cn":"满满小心！有野兽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD643B4C033B0768","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:8:13051214:0":{"text":